</section>

<!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────── §06 ── -->
<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Results</div>
<h2>Competitive with AR Models — Except on Commonsense</h2>
<p>Sumi-7B is evaluated against three open AR models trained on comparable token budgets: Falcon-7B (1.5T tokens), Llama 2-7B (2T tokens), and OLMo-7B (2.5T tokens). The comparison is made under a single unified evaluation protocol using <em>lm-evaluation-harness</em>.</p>

